{"seq":1,"slug":"the-master-of-those-who-know","title":"The Master Of Those Who Know","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/the-master-of-those-who-know","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"philosophy-for-millennia","title":"影响千年的哲学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/the-master-of-those-who-know/philosophy-for-millennia","wordCount":1547,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-aristotelian-tradition","title":"亚里士多德主义传统","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/influence-and-legacy/the-master-of-those-who-know/the-aristotelian-tradition","wordCount":1698,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章呈现亚里士多德作为&quot;知者之师&quot;影响千年的崇高地位。但丁尊他为&quot;知者之师&quot;，中世纪更直接称他为&quot;那位哲学家&quot;——在长达近两千年里，他一直是西方乃至阿拉伯世界知识与学问的最高权威，深刻地塑造了西方的心智。他的思想，更催生了源远流长的&quot;亚里士多德主义&quot;传统。本章揭示亚里士多德影响千年的深远作用。</p>\n"}